OL,3,GNEWSA'Burnout, stress and anxiety'
OL,4,Aleading to industrial action for
OL,5,Ateachers
OL,6,
OL,7,FA west Belfast primary school teacher
OL,8,Fhas described the "burnout, stress and
OL,9,Fanxiety" experienced by many in the
OL,10,Fworkforce as they struggle to cope with
OL,11,Fincreasing workloads.
OL,13,FIt comes as Northern Ireland's five
OL,14,Fteaching unions voted for industrial
OL,15,Faction if their grievances concerning
OL,16,Fworkload were not addressed.
OL,18,FEducation Minister Paul Givan said he
OL,19,Fwas "fully committed" to reducing
OL,20,Fteacher and headteacher workload and
OL,21,Fthat he hoped further negotiations
OL,22,Fwould help avert action.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
