OL,3,GNEWSA'Burnout, stress and anxiety'
OL,4,Aleading to industrial action for
OL,5,Ateachers
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Kerr, head of key stage one at St
OL,8,FPaul's Primary School, said between
OL,9,Fadditional administration and pastoral
OL,10,Fcare, he routinely worked over his
OL,11,Fcontracted hours.
